   "reading": "the same three turns fail in EVERY configuration that reaches 83%. They are the three shortest in the passage and sit under the 0.6s minimum the embedder needs. Sub-second backchannels are where this method stops. Turn 8 is also the turn the gold data flags as carrying no textual cue at all, so neither signal reaches it."
